<newsitem itemid="251673" id="root" date="1996-12-12" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Teltron half year earnings edges up.</title>
<headline>Teltron half year earnings edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Oct 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   18.5	  vs 17.5</p>
<p>    Headline earnings     10.29	 vs 9.76</p>
<p>    Net income		11.97	 vs 9.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   15.15	 vs 15.01</p>
<p>    Tax			 3.21	  vs 5.25</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   2.36	  vs 0.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		  226.55	vs 185.49</p>
<p>    Full name: Teltron Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     0.65 loss   vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Teltron said it is the firm's policy not to declare an interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
